TrackingEvent --> TrackView : TrackInitiated, TrackUpdated
InterceptEvent --> PlanId : PlanEvaluated
InterceptEvent --> PlanView : PlanProposed, PlanApproved, PlanSuperseded
InterceptEvent --> VerdictSummary : PlanEvaluated
